NEthack With Tiles - 1.2.0
--------------------------

http://www.darkarts.co.za/projects/newt/

This NetHack & SLASH'EM graphical interface aims to mimic the tty
version of NetHack as much as possible, but with tiles.

Most notable features

     * support most tilesets and most image formats
     * sound support (via pmatch)
     * joystick support
     * many zoom modes to best view your game.
     * realtime switching between tiled, ascii view

